    },
    "Asks first, then deletes this feed, its downloads, and what it kept of downloads you removed" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Delete Feed button in Feed Info.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Fragt zuerst nach und löscht dann diesen Feed, seine Downloads und das, was er von entfernten Downloads behalten hat."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta antes de eliminar este canal, sus descargas y lo que conservó de las descargas que quitaste"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Demande d’abord, puis supprime ce flux, ses téléchargements et ce qu’il a conservé des téléchargements retirés"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Chiede conferma, poi elimina questo feed, i suoi download e ciò che ha conservato dei download rimossi."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Pergunta primeiro e depois exclui este feed, os downloads dele e o que guardou de downloads removidos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks first, then gives the library a new identity and opens it." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the button that gives the library a new identity file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Fragt zuerst nach, gibt der Bibliothek dann eine neue Identität und öffnet sie."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Pregunta primero, luego da una identidad nueva a la biblioteca y la abre."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Demande d’abord, puis donne une nouvelle identité à la bibliothèque et l’ouvre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Chiede conferma, poi assegna alla libreria una nuova identità e la apre."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Pergunta antes, depois dá à biblioteca uma nova identidade e a abre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks first, then makes a new library index from the books in this folder and opens the library." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the button that opens the library without its index file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Fragt zuerst nach, erstellt dann einen neuen Suchindex aus den Büchern in diesem Ordner und öffnet die Bibliothek."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
