        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ela contém o registro de “%1$@”: %2$@; o registro contém %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is a streaming playlist for web audio, which TextMouth does not import." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal of a playlist that is an HLS stream, a list of pieces of one broadcast on the web. \"It\" is the playlist. Follows the sentence naming the file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sie ist eine Streaming-Playlist für Web-Audio, die TextMouth nicht importiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Es una lista de reproducción en streaming para audio web, que TextMouth no importa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "C’est une playlist de diffusion en continu pour de l’audio web, que TextMouth n’importe pas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "È una playlist di streaming per audio web, che TextMouth non importa."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "É uma playlist de streaming de áudio da web, que o TextMouth não importa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is the folder of the feed %@. Either way, the feed and its downloads stay, listed in no folder until Feed Info gives the feed another; Delete Feed… on its row deletes it." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the dialog that asks how to delete a folder, when it is the folder of one feed. %@ is the feed's title in quotation marks. \"Feed Info\" and \"Delete Feed…\" name a sheet and a command.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Er ist der Ordner des Feeds %@. In beiden Fällen bleiben der Feed und seine Downloads erhalten, in keinem Ordner aufgelistet, bis „Feed-Info“ dem Feed einen anderen gibt; „Feed löschen…“ in seiner Zeile löscht ihn."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Es la carpeta del canal %@. De cualquier modo, el canal y sus descargas permanecen, sin carpeta, hasta que Información del canal le dé otra; Eliminar canal… en su fila lo elimina."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "C’est le dossier du flux %@. Dans les deux cas, le flux et ses téléchargements restent, sans dossier, jusqu’à ce que Informations sur le flux lui en donne un autre ; Supprimer le flux… sur sa ligne le supprime."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "È la cartella del feed %@. In entrambi i casi il feed e i suoi download restano, senza cartella, finché Info feed non gli assegna un’altra cartella; Elimina feed… sulla sua riga lo elimina."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "É a pasta do feed %@. De qualquer forma, o feed e seus arquivos baixados permanecem, sem pasta, até que Informações do feed dê outra a ele; Excluir feed… na linha dele o exclui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is the folder of the feeds %@. Either way, the feeds and their downloads stay, listed in no folder until Feed Info gives each another; Delete Feed… on a feed's row deletes it." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the dialog that asks how to delete a folder, when it is the folder of several feeds. %@ is a list of the feeds' titles in quotation marks. \"Feed Info\" and \"Delete Feed…\" name a sheet and a command.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Er ist der Ordner der Feeds %@. In beiden Fällen bleiben die Feeds und ihre Downloads erhalten, in keinem Ordner aufgelistet, bis „Feed-Info“ jedem einen anderen gibt; „Feed löschen…“ in der Zeile eines Feeds löscht ihn."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Es la carpeta de los canales %@. De cualquier modo, los canales y sus descargas permanecen, sin carpeta, hasta que Información del canal dé otra a cada uno; Eliminar canal… en la fila de un canal lo elimina."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "C’est le dossier des flux %@. Dans les deux cas, les flux et leurs téléchargements restent, sans dossier, jusqu’à ce que Informations sur le flux en donne un autre à chacun ; Supprimer le flux… sur la ligne d’un flux le supprime."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "È la cartella dei feed %@. In entrambi i casi i feed e i loro download restano, senza cartella, finché Info feed non assegna a ciascuno un’altra cartella; Elimina feed… sulla riga di un feed lo elimina."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "É a pasta dos feeds %@. De qualquer forma, os feeds e seus arquivos baixados permanecem, sem pasta, até que Informações do feed dê outra a cada um; Excluir feed… na linha de um feed o exclui."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It lists no audio track with a start that TextMouth can read." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal of a cue sheet chosen on its own that places no track. \"It\" is the cue sheet. Follows the sentence naming the file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Darin ist kein Audiotrack mit einem Start verzeichnet, den TextMouth lesen kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No indica ninguna pista de audio con un inicio que TextMouth pueda leer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Elle ne répertorie aucune piste audio dont TextMouth puisse lire le début."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non elenca nessuna traccia audio con un inizio che TextMouth possa leggere."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Não lista nenhuma faixa de áudio com um início que o TextMouth possa ler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It lists only web addresses, and TextMouth imports only files on this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal of a playlist that lists only web addresses. \"It\" is the playlist. Follows the sentence naming the file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Darin stehen nur Webadressen, und TextMouth importiert nur Dateien auf diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Solo enumera direcciones web, y TextMouth solo importa archivos de esta Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Elle ne répertorie que des adresses web, et TextMouth n’importe que des fichiers présents sur ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Elenca solo indirizzi web, e TextMouth importa solo file presenti su questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Lista apenas endereços da web, e o TextMouth importa apenas arquivos deste Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It lists the book's tracks in play order, each with its heading's title. You can reorder, retitle, and group them under headings of your own, and set the pauses between them." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the Edit Manifest explanation: what the manifest lists and what the user can change in it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Enumera las pistas del libro en orden de reproducción, cada una con el título de su encabezado. Puedes reordenarlas, cambiarles el título, agruparlas bajo encabezados propios y fijar las pausas entre ellas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il liste les pistes du livre dans l’ordre de lecture, chacune avec le titre de son en-tête. Vous pouvez les réordonner, les renommer, les regrouper sous vos propres en-têtes et régler les pauses entre elles."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Elenca le tracce del libro nell’ordine di riproduzione, ciascuna con il titolo della sua intestazione. Puoi riordinarle, cambiarne il titolo, raggrupparle sotto intestazioni tue e impostare le pause tra l’una e l’altra."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele lista as faixas do livro na ordem de reprodução, cada uma com o título do seu cabeçalho. Você pode reordená-las, renomeá-las e agrupá-las sob cabeçalhos próprios, além de definir as pausas entre elas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be damaged, or another kind of file." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the refusal of a document that could not be read: the file may be damaged or of another kind.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Möglicherweise ist die Datei beschädigt oder von einer anderen Art."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Puede estar dañado, o ser otro tipo de archivo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il est peut-être endommagé, ou d’un autre type de fichier."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Potrebbe essere danneggiato, o di un altro tipo di file."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele pode estar danificado ou ser outro tipo de arquivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be paused, signed out, or not running." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of why a book download stopped: the likely causes. \"It\" is the cloud service.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Dienst ist möglicherweise pausiert, abgemeldet oder läuft nicht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Puede estar en pausa, con la sesión cerrada o sin ejecutarse."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il est peut-être en pause, déconnecté ou à l’arrêt."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Potrebbe essere in pausa, aver perso l’accesso o non essere in esecuzione."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele pode estar pausado, sem login ou fora de execução."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have been moved or renamed, or %@ may not have synced it to this Mac yet." : {
      "comment" : "The likely cause of a missing folder in a cloud service's folder. %@ is the cloud service's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Er wurde möglicherweise verschoben oder umbenannt, oder %@ hat ihn noch nicht mit diesem Mac synchronisiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Puede que se haya movido o cambiado de nombre, o que %@ aún no lo haya sincronizado con esta Mac."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il a peut-être été déplacé ou renommé, ou %@ ne l’a peut-être pas encore synchronisé avec ce Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Potrebbe essere stata spostata o rinominata, oppure %@ potrebbe non averla ancora sincronizzata con questo Mac."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ela pode ter sido movida ou renomeada, ou %@ pode ainda não a ter sincronizado com este Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It names no audio file in its own folder that TextMouth can import." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal of a playlist or cue sheet with no track left to import. \"It\" is the playlist. A sentence about the skipped entries may follow.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Darin ist keine Audiodatei im eigenen Ordner genannt, die TextMouth importieren kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No nombra ningún archivo de audio en su propia carpeta que TextMouth pueda importar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Elle ne désigne aucun fichier audio de son propre dossier que TextMouth puisse importer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non indica nessun file audio nella sua cartella che TextMouth possa importare."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Não cita nenhum arquivo de áudio na própria pasta que o TextMouth possa importar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It runs only through ffmpeg." : {
      "comment" : "Ends a line under a filter preset's chain field that says why TextMouth's own filters can't run it: only the ffmpeg program can. ffmpeg is the program's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sie läuft nur über ffmpeg."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Solo se ejecuta con ffmpeg."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Elle ne s’exécute qu’avec ffmpeg."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Funziona solo con ffmpeg."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ele só é executado pelo ffmpeg."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It skipped %lld entries: %@." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence after the refusal of a playlist: how many entries it skipped, and which. %1$lld is the number of entries and %2$@ the list of them, each with its reason in parentheses.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "%lld Eintrag übersprungen: %@."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "%lld Einträge übersprungen: %@."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It skipped %lld entry: %@."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "It skipped %lld entries: %@."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "many" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "Omitió %lld de entradas: %@."
                }
              },
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "Omitió %lld entrada: %@."
                }
