    },
    "Its cleanup is replaced too." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence of the question asked before a transcript from a file replaces the book's, when the user had cleaned it up.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Auch die Bereinigung wird ersetzt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Su limpieza también se reemplaza."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Son nettoyage est aussi remplacé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Anche la sua pulizia viene sostituita."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A limpeza dela também é substituída."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its conditions and sort are deleted. The books, episodes, articles, and feeds it lists stay in the library, and a Library window showing it shows another view." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). What the question says Delete does, and what it keeps.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ihre Bedingungen und ihre Sortierung werden gelöscht. Die Bücher, Folgen, Artikel und Feeds, die sie auflistet, bleiben in der Bibliothek, und ein Bibliotheksfenster, das sie zeigt, zeigt eine andere Ansicht."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminan sus condiciones y su orden. Los libros, episodios, artículos y canales que muestra permanecen en la biblioteca, y una ventana de la biblioteca que la muestre pasa a mostrar otra vista."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ses conditions et son tri sont supprimés. Les livres, épisodes, articles et flux qu’elle liste restent dans la bibliothèque, et une fenêtre de bibliothèque qui l’affiche affiche une autre vue."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le sue condizioni e il suo ordinamento vengono eliminati. I libri, gli episodi, gli articoli e i feed che elenca restano nella libreria, e una finestra della libreria che la mostra ne mostra un’altra."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Suas condições e ordem são excluídas. Os livros, episódios, artigos e feeds que ela lista permanecem na biblioteca, e uma janela da biblioteca que a exibe passa a exibir outra visualização."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its contents aren't on this Mac yet, so TextMouth hasn't looked inside it." : {
      "comment" : "Part of the report of a conflicting copy: the copy's file is only in the cloud, so TextMouth did not download it to look inside. \"It\" is the copy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Ihr Inhalt ist noch nicht auf diesem Mac, daher hat TextMouth nicht hineingeschaut."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Su contenido aún no está en esta Mac, así que TextMouth no ha mirado dentro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Son contenu n’est pas encore sur ce Mac, donc TextMouth n’a pas regardé à l’intérieur."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "I suoi contenuti non sono ancora su questo Mac, quindi TextMouth non ne ha guardato l’interno."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O conteúdo dela ainda não está neste Mac, então o TextMouth não olhou dentro dela."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its download can't be removed until it has uploaded." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of why Remove Download was refused after a failed upload.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Download kann erst entfernt werden, wenn das Buch hochgeladen ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Su descarga no se puede quitar hasta que se haya subido."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Son téléchargement ne peut pas être retiré tant qu’il n’a pas été envoyé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il suo download non può essere rimosso finché non è stato caricato."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O download dele não pode ser removido até que ele seja enviado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its earlier text was kept as %@, in the book's package." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence saying where a backup of a book's earlier text was kept. %@ is a file name such as content.md.edited-20261024T123012Z, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Su texto anterior se conservó como %@, en el paquete del libro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Son texte précédent a été conservé sous le nom %@, dans le paquet du livre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il testo precedente è stato conservato come %@, nel pacchetto del libro."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O texto anterior foi guardado como %@, no pacote do livro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its file is now “%@”, since TextMouth can't write its old format." : {
      "comment" : "Said as a save ends and the book's file got a new name because TextMouth can't write the old format. %@ is the file's new name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
