            "value" : "Accetta da %1$lld a %2$lld minuti."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aceita de %1$lld a %2$lld minutos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes %lld to %lld minutes. Return sets the timer and plays the book." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the sleep timer sheet's custom minutes field on the Mac: the fewest and most minutes it takes, and what the Return key does there. %1$lld is the fewest (1); %2$lld the most (480). Return is the name of the key.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Akzeptiert %1$lld bis %2$lld Minuten. Mit Return wird der Timer gesetzt und das Buch wiedergegeben."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Takes %1$lld to %2$lld minutes. Return sets the timer and plays the book."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Admite de %1$lld a %2$lld minutos. Retorno programa el temporizador y reproduce el libro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Accepte de %1$lld à %2$lld minutes. La touche Retour règle le minuteur et lit le livre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Accetta da %1$lld a %2$lld minuti. Invio imposta il timer e riproduce il libro."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Aceita de %1$lld a %2$lld minutos. Return define o timer e reproduz o livro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes each finished book off the list when its window moves on or closes. Books finished before you turn it on stay." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Reading List's Remove books when finished checkbox.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Entfernt jedes beendete Buch aus der Liste, wenn sein Fenster weiterwechselt oder geschlossen wird. Bücher, die vor dem Aktivieren beendet wurden, bleiben."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Quita de la lista cada libro terminado cuando su ventana pasa a otro libro o se cierra. Los libros terminados antes de activarlo se quedan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Retire chaque livre terminé de la liste quand sa fenêtre passe à autre chose ou se ferme. Les livres terminés avant l’activation restent."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Toglie dall’elenco ogni libro terminato quando la sua finestra passa oltre o si chiude. I libri terminati prima che tu lo attivi restano."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tira cada livro concluído da lista quando sua janela passa adiante ou fecha. Livros concluídos antes de você ativar isso permanecem."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Takes the selected books off the reading list. They stay in the library." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Library's edit-mode bar button Remove from Reading List.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
