    "TextMouth downloads %lld of them again at their feeds' next checks, or the next time it opens." : {
      "comment" : "After Cancel stops feed downloads, several of which TextMouth downloads again by itself. %lld is how many of them it downloads again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "TextMouth lädt %lld davon bei der nächsten Prüfung seines Feeds oder beim nächsten Öffnen erneut herunter."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
                  "value" : "TextMouth lädt %lld davon bei der nächsten Prüfung ihrer Feeds oder beim nächsten Öffnen erneut herunter."
