    "TextMouth downloads 1 of them again at its feed's next check, or the next time it opens." : {
      "comment" : "After Cancel stops feed downloads, exactly one of which TextMouth downloads again by itself.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
