            "value" : "O TextMouth não está baixando agora."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth is opening again on another library, so they stay unsaved in this one." : {
      "comment" : "Why a failed save stays unsaved: TextMouth is switching to another library. \"They\" is the changes that could not be saved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth wird erneut mit einer anderen Bibliothek geöffnet, daher bleiben sie in dieser ungesichert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth se está abriendo de nuevo con otra biblioteca, así que siguen sin guardarse en esta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth se rouvre sur une autre bibliothèque ; elles restent donc non enregistrées dans celle-ci."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth si sta riaprendo su un’altra libreria, quindi restano non salvate in questa."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth está abrindo de novo em outra biblioteca, então elas continuam sem salvar nesta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth is opening again on another library, so they stay where they are in this one." : {
      "comment" : "Why a failed move of files stays undone: TextMouth is switching to another library. \"They\" is the files.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth wird erneut mit einer anderen Bibliothek geöffnet, daher bleiben sie in dieser, wo sie sind."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth se está abriendo de nuevo con otra biblioteca, así que siguen donde están en esta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth se rouvre sur une autre bibliothèque ; ils restent donc là où ils sont dans celle-ci."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth si sta riaprendo su un’altra libreria, quindi restano dove sono in questa."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth está abrindo de novo em outra biblioteca, então eles continuam onde estão nesta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth is quitting and the book's audio doesn't hold these edits yet. Discard undoes them; next time you edit this book, Redo brings them back until you make another edit. Cancel keeps TextMouth open." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the question about the audio editor's unsaved edits asked as TextMouth quits: what Discard and Cancel do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth wird beendet, und das Audio des Buchs enthält diese Bearbeitungen noch nicht. „Verwerfen“ widerruft sie; wenn du dieses Buch das nächste Mal bearbeitest, bringt „Wiederholen“ sie zurück, bis du erneut bearbeitest. „Abbrechen“ lässt TextMouth geöffnet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth se está cerrando y el audio del libro aún no contiene estas ediciones. Descartar las deshace; la próxima vez que edites este libro, Rehacer las recupera hasta que hagas otra edición. Cancelar mantiene TextMouth abierto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth se ferme et l’audio du livre ne contient pas encore ces modifications. Abandonner les annule ; la prochaine fois que vous modifiez ce livre, Rétablir les restaure jusqu’à ce que vous fassiez une autre modification. Annuler garde TextMouth ouvert."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth sta per chiudersi e l’audio del libro non contiene ancora queste modifiche. Scarta le annulla; la prossima volta che modifichi questo libro, Ripeti le riporta indietro finché non fai un’altra modifica. Annulla mantiene TextMouth aperto."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth está sendo encerrado e o áudio do livro ainda não contém estas edições. Descartar as desfaz; na próxima vez que você editar este livro, Refazer as traz de volta até você fazer outra edição. Cancelar mantém o TextMouth aberto."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth is reading the library's text again. Try again when that finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. Why a book can't be read again while the library's text is being read again (the launch batch, Redo Text Extraction), in the words TextMouth uses while its storage work is held (StorageBusyError).",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth liest gerade den Text der Bibliothek erneut. Versuche es noch einmal, wenn das beendet ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth está volviendo a leer el texto de la biblioteca. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando termine."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth relit le texte de la bibliothèque. Réessayez quand ce sera fini."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth sta rileggendo il testo della libreria. Riprova quando ha finito."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth está relendo o texto da biblioteca. Tente novamente quando terminar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth is reading “%@” again in another encoding. Try again when that finishes." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. Why what would rewrite the text of the book titled bookTitle waits while TextMouth reads it again in another encoding, in the same words as extractionRefusal: a second re-read of it, Edit Text, Redo Text Extraction, and Replace Existing (LibraryViewModel.readingAgainRefusal(of:)). Placeholders in order: bookTitle.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth liest „%@“ gerade in einer anderen Codierung erneut. Versuche es noch einmal, wenn das beendet ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
