          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth isn't allowed to post notifications. Turn them on in System Settings, Notifications, TextMouth." : {
      "comment" : "What the notifications setting's help says while macOS does not allow TextMouth to post notifications. System Settings and Notifications are macOS's own names, in the language of macOS.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth darf keine Mitteilungen senden. Schalte sie unter Systemeinstellungen, Mitteilungen, TextMouth ein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth no tiene permiso para enviar notificaciones. Actívalas en Ajustes del Sistema, Notificaciones, TextMouth."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth n’est pas autorisé à publier des notifications. Activez-les dans Réglages Système, Notifications, TextMouth."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth non può inviare notifiche. Attivale in Impostazioni di Sistema, Notifiche, TextMouth."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth não tem permissão para publicar notificações. Ative-as em Ajustes do Sistema, Notificações, TextMouth."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth isn't allowed to use the microphone. Turn it on in System Settings, Privacy & Security, Microphone." : {
      "comment" : "Error in the Record window when macOS has denied TextMouth the microphone. Names the places in System Settings, as macOS words them, where the user can allow it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth darf das Mikrofon nicht verwenden. Aktiviere es in den Systemeinstellungen unter „Datenschutz & Sicherheit“, „Mikrofon“."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth no tiene permiso para usar el micrófono. Actívalo en Ajustes del Sistema, Privacidad y seguridad, Micrófono."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth n’a pas l’autorisation d’utiliser le microphone. Activez-la dans Réglages Système, Confidentialité et sécurité, Microphone."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth non può usare il microfono. Attivalo in Impostazioni di Sistema, Privacy e sicurezza, Microfono."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth não tem permissão para usar o microfone. Ative em Ajustes do Sistema, Privacidade e Segurança, Microfone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth keeps the original file of audio it converts at import. An original takes about as much disk space as its converted file, or twice as much when uncompressed. Export offers it as the Original file. A feed episode's original is not kept: it can be downloaded again." : {
      "comment" : "Caption under the Keep Originals switch while it is on. \"Original file\" names the choice Export offers; keep it the same as that choice's translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth behält die Originaldatei von Audio, das es beim Import umwandelt. Ein Original braucht ungefähr so viel Speicherplatz wie seine umgewandelte Datei, unkomprimiert doppelt so viel. Der Export bietet es als „Originaldatei“ an. Das Original einer Feed-Folge wird nicht behalten: Sie lässt sich erneut herunterladen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth conserva el archivo original del audio que convierte al importar. Un original ocupa casi tanto espacio en disco como su archivo convertido, o el doble si no está comprimido. Exportar lo ofrece como Archivo original. El original de un episodio de un canal no se conserva: se puede descargar de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth conserve le fichier d’origine de l’audio qu’il convertit à l’importation. Un original occupe à peu près autant d’espace disque que son fichier converti, ou deux fois plus s’il n’est pas compressé. L’exportation le propose comme Fichier d’origine. L’original d’un épisode de flux n’est pas conservé : il peut être téléchargé de nouveau."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth conserva il file originale dell’audio che converte all’importazione. Un originale occupa circa lo stesso spazio su disco del file convertito, o il doppio se non compresso. L’esportazione lo offre come File originale. L’originale di un episodio di feed non viene conservato: può essere scaricato di nuovo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth mantém o arquivo original do áudio que converte na importação. Um original ocupa cerca do mesmo espaço em disco que o arquivo convertido, ou o dobro quando não é compactado. A exportação o oferece como Arquivo original. O original de um episódio de feed não é mantido: ele pode ser baixado novamente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth kept the text you changed in %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the message when an automatic rebuild left a book's edited text alone. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth conservó el texto que cambiaste en %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth a conservé le texte que vous avez modifié dans %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth ha conservato il testo modificato in %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth manteve o texto que você alterou em %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth left it there and is still using %@." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of why a move of the data directory did not finish, when one item appeared: TextMouth left the item and kept using the current data directory. %@ is the current data directory's path.\nSecond sentence of why a move of the data directory did not finish: TextMouth left what was put there and kept using the current data directory. %@ is the current data directory's path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth hat es dort belassen und verwendet weiterhin %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth lo dejó allí y sigue usando %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth l’a laissé là et utilise toujours %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth l’ha lasciato lì e sta ancora usando %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth o deixou lá e ainda está usando %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth left out %@, which hold no sound it can read." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that a book left out several files that hold no sound TextMouth can read. %@ is the files' count and names, such as \"2 files, “a.spx” and “b.spx”\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth hat %@ ausgelassen, die keinen Ton enthalten, den es lesen kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth omitió %@, que no contienen sonido que pueda leer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth a écarté %@, qui ne contiennent aucun son qu’il peut lire."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth ha escluso %@, che non contengono audio leggibile."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth deixou de fora %@, que não contêm som que ele possa ler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth left out %@, which holds no sound it can read." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that a book left out one file that holds no sound TextMouth can read. %@ is the file's name in curly quotes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth hat %@ ausgelassen, da die Datei keinen Ton enthält, den es lesen kann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth omitió %@, que no contiene sonido que pueda leer."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth a écarté %@, qui ne contient aucun son qu’il peut lire."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth ha escluso %@, che non contiene audio leggibile."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth deixou de fora %@, que não contém som que ele possa ler."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth left out %@, which need TextMouth's converter, missing from the app." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that a book left out several files that only TextMouth's own converter reads, because the converter is missing from the app. %@ is the files' count and names, such as \"2 files, “a.avi” and “b.wmv”\". Advice to install the app again follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth hat %@ ausgelassen, für die das Umwandlungsprogramm von TextMouth nötig ist, das in der App fehlt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth omitió %@, que necesitan el conversor de TextMouth, que falta en la app."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth a écarté %@, qui nécessitent le convertisseur de TextMouth, absent de l’app."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "TextMouth ha escluso %@, che richiedono il convertitore di TextMouth, mancante nell’app."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O TextMouth deixou de fora %@, que precisam do conversor do TextMouth, ausente do app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth left out %@, which needs TextMouth's converter, missing from the app." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that a book left out one file that only TextMouth's own converter reads, because the converter is missing from the app. %@ is the file's name in curly quotes. Advice to install the app again follows.",
