            "value" : "O arquivo compactado se expande para %1$@, mais do que os %2$@ que o TextMouth extrai de arquivos compactados sem áudio."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The archive holds %@ files and folders, more than the %@ TextMouth extracts in one import." : {
      "comment" : "Why an import's archive was refused: it holds too many files and folders. %1$@ is how many it holds, already formatted; %2$@ is the limit, already formatted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Archiv enthält %1$@ Dateien und Ordner, mehr als die %2$@, die TextMouth bei einem Import extrahiert."
