            "value" : "O arquivo de áudio %@ termina antes do áudio que deveria conter, então não foi possível convertê-lo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The audio file %@ has %lld channels but does not say which is which, so TextMouth cannot mix it to stereo." : {
      "comment" : "Why an audio file was not converted: it has more than two channels and does not say which is which, so a mix to stereo would keep two arbitrary channels. %1$@ is the file's name and %2$lld the number of channels, always more than two.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "machine_translated",
