            "value" : "O arquivo do livro como foi importado; para um audiolivro, seus arquivos de áudio antes de o TextMouth convertê-los."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's files aren't on this Mac yet. %@ may still be syncing them." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book can't be used yet: its files have not arrived. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"The cloud service\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Dateien des Buchs sind noch nicht auf diesem Mac. %@ synchronisiert sie möglicherweise noch."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
