          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library already had different content under its package name, %@, so it was stored in a new package, %@, and its original file was kept at %@." : {
      "comment" : "Warning about a book that moved into the current library format. %1$@ is the name of the package that already held other content; %2$@ is the name of the new package; %3$@ is the path where the original file was kept.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek hatte unter ihrem Paketnamen %1$@ bereits anderen Inhalt, daher wurde das Buch in einem neuen Paket, %2$@, gespeichert, und seine Originaldatei wurde unter %3$@ behalten."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The library already had different content under its package name, %1$@, so it was stored in a new package, %2$@, and its original file was kept at %3$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca ya tenía contenido distinto con el nombre de paquete %1$@, así que se guardó en un paquete nuevo, %2$@, y su archivo original se conservó en %3$@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La bibliothèque contenait déjà un contenu différent sous le nom de paquet %1$@ ; il a donc été stocké dans un nouveau paquet, %2$@, et son fichier d’origine a été conservé dans %3$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria aveva già un contenuto diverso con il nome del suo pacchetto, %@, quindi è stato archiviato in un nuovo pacchetto, %@, e il suo file originale è stato conservato in %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A biblioteca já tinha conteúdo diferente com o nome de pacote %1$@, então ele foi guardado em um novo pacote, %2$@, e o arquivo original foi mantido em %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library at %@ isn't available." : {
      "comment" : "Error text when the library's folder can't be used. It follows what failed, as in \"Listening statistics could not be saved: The library at /Volumes/Backup/TextMouth isn't available.\" %@ is the folder's path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek in %@ ist nicht verfügbar."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca de %@ no está disponible."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La bibliothèque dans %@ n’est pas disponible."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria in %@ non è disponibile."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A biblioteca em %@ não está disponível."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't be reached, so TextMouth can't keep the new copy of “%@”. Answer again once it is back." : {
      "comment" : "What the duplicate question says when Keep Both or Replace Existing is chosen while the library cannot be reached. %@ is the new copy's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek ist nicht erreichbar, daher kann TextMouth die neue Kopie von „%@“ nicht behalten. Antworte erneut, sobald sie wieder da ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede acceder a la biblioteca, así que TextMouth no puede conservar la copia nueva de “%@”. Responde de nuevo cuando vuelva."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La bibliothèque est inaccessible, donc TextMouth ne peut pas conserver la nouvelle copie de « %@ ». Répondez de nouveau quand elle sera de retour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non è raggiungibile, quindi TextMouth non può conservare la nuova copia di «%@». Rispondi di nuovo quando sarà tornata."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Não foi possível acessar a biblioteca, então o TextMouth não pode manter a nova cópia de “%@”. Responda novamente quando ela voltar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move books now. Try again once it is available." : {
      "comment" : "Why Move to Library did nothing: the library's index is being recovered or the data directory is away or moving. Follows \"Could not move to the library: \".",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek kann jetzt keine Bücher verschieben. Versuche es erneut, sobald sie verfügbar ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no puede mover libros ahora. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando esté disponible."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La bibliothèque ne peut pas déplacer de livres pour le moment. Réessayez quand elle sera disponible."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non può spostare libri ora. Riprova quando sarà disponibile."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A biblioteca não pode mover livros agora. Tente novamente quando ela estiver disponível."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move while a book is open. Close %@ first." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the library was refused: a book is open in a reader. %@ is the book's title, in quotation marks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek kann nicht verschoben werden, solange ein Buch geöffnet ist. Schließe zuerst %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no se puede mover mientras hay un libro abierto. Cierra primero %@."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La bibliothèque ne peut pas être déplacée tant qu’un livre est ouvert. Fermez d’abord %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non può essere spostata mentre un libro è aperto. Chiudi prima %@."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A biblioteca não pode ser movida enquanto um livro está aberto. Feche %@ primeiro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move while a book is open. Close it first." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the library was refused: a book is open in a reader. \"It\" is that book.",
      "localizations" : {
