          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O índice migrado da biblioteca não pôde ser validado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most time the whole sequence may take. Shorter windows mean fewer accidental matches but quicker presses." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the restart gesture's time window slider in the Miscellaneous settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die längste Zeit, die die gesamte Folge dauern darf. Kürzere Zeitfenster bedeuten weniger versehentliche Treffer, aber schnelleres Drücken."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo máximo que puede durar toda la secuencia. Ventanas más cortas significan menos coincidencias accidentales pero pulsaciones más rápidas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le temps maximal que la séquence entière peut prendre. Des fenêtres plus courtes donnent moins de correspondances accidentelles, mais exigent des appuis plus rapides."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il tempo massimo che l’intera sequenza può richiedere. Intervalli più brevi significano meno corrispondenze accidentali ma pressioni più rapide."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O tempo máximo que a sequência inteira pode levar. Janelas menores significam menos correspondências acidentais, mas pressionamentos mais rápidos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move was cancelled, so nothing changed." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the data directory ended: the listener cancelled it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Verschieben wurde abgebrochen, daher hat sich nichts geändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se canceló el traslado, así que no cambió nada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le déplacement a été annulé ; rien n’a donc changé."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Lo spostamento è stato annullato, quindi nulla è cambiato."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A movimentação foi cancelada, então nada mudou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new copy replaced “%@”, but the old copy's files could not be deleted and stay in its folder: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Alert after Replace Existing when the old copy's files could not be deleted. %1$@ is the book's title. %2$@ is why they could not be deleted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die neue Kopie hat „%1$@“ ersetzt, aber die Dateien der alten Kopie konnten nicht gelöscht werden und bleiben in ihrem Ordner: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The new copy replaced “%1$@”, but the old copy's files could not be deleted and stay in its folder: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia nueva reemplazó “%1$@”, pero los archivos de la copia anterior no se pudieron eliminar y permanecen en su carpeta: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La nouvelle copie a remplacé « %@ », mais les fichiers de l’ancienne copie n’ont pas pu être supprimés et restent dans son dossier : %@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La nuova copia ha sostituito «%@», ma i file della vecchia copia non sono stati eliminati e restano nella sua cartella: %@"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A nova cópia substituiu “%1$@”, mas os arquivos da cópia antiga não puderam ser excluídos e permanecem na pasta dela: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new copy replaced “%@”, but the old copy's files could not be moved to the Trash and stay in its folder: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Alert after Replace Existing when the old copy's files could not be moved to the Trash. %1$@ is the book's title. %2$@ is why they could not be moved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die neue Kopie hat „%1$@“ ersetzt, aber die Dateien der alten Kopie konnten nicht in den Papierkorb gelegt werden und bleiben in ihrem Ordner: %2$@"
