        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A nova cópia substituiu “%1$@”, mas os arquivos da cópia antiga não puderam ser movidos para a Lixeira e permanecem na pasta dela: %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new location, %@, contains the current data directory, %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a move of the data directory was refused. %1$@ is the new location's path; %2$@ is the current data directory, with the link that leads to it when there is one.",
