          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original file was kept: TextMouth imported only the DAISY book “%@” from the archive “%@”." : {
      "comment" : "Notice after one DAISY book was imported from an archive of other books, so the original file was kept. %1$@ is the book's title and %2$@ the archive's file name. A sentence about the other books follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Originaldatei wurde behalten: TextMouth hat nur das DAISY-Buch „%1$@“ aus dem Archiv „%2$@“ importiert."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The original file was kept: TextMouth imported only the DAISY book “%1$@” from the archive “%2$@”."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se conservó el archivo original: TextMouth importó solo el libro DAISY “%1$@” del archivo comprimido “%2$@”."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le fichier d’origine a été conservé : TextMouth n’a importé que le livre DAISY « %1$@ » de l’archive « %2$@ »."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il file originale è stato conservato: TextMouth ha importato solo il libro DAISY «%1$@» dall’archivio «%2$@»."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O arquivo original foi mantido: o TextMouth importou apenas o livro DAISY “%1$@” do arquivo compactado “%2$@”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original file was kept: TextMouth imported the audio of “%@” from the archive “%@”, and the archive is the only copy of its text." : {
      "comment" : "Notice after the audio of a DAISY book was imported from an archive that keeps its text, so the original file was kept. %1$@ is the book's title and %2$@ the archive's file name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Originaldatei wurde behalten: TextMouth hat das Audio von „%1$@“ aus dem Archiv „%2$@“ importiert, und das Archiv ist die einzige Kopie seines Textes."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The original file was kept: TextMouth imported the audio of “%1$@” from the archive “%2$@”, and the archive is the only copy of its text."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se conservó el archivo original: TextMouth importó el audio de “%1$@” del archivo comprimido “%2$@”, y ese archivo es la única copia de su texto."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Le fichier d’origine a été conservé : TextMouth a importé l’audio de « %1$@ » depuis l’archive « %2$@ », et l’archive est la seule copie de son texte."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il file originale è stato conservato: TextMouth ha importato l’audio di «%1$@» dall’archivio «%2$@», e l’archivio è l’unica copia del suo testo."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "O arquivo original foi mantido: o TextMouth importou o áudio de “%1$@” do arquivo compactado “%2$@”, e o arquivo compactado é a única cópia do texto dele."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original file was kept: it is a folder, and an import never deletes a folder." : {
      "comment" : "Notice after a book was imported from a folder, such as an RTFD: the original was kept because an import never deletes a folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
