      "comment" : "Label of the Reading List's options bar pop-up button choosing what a book opened from the list does when it ends: play the book below, play the book above, or stop.\nLabel of the pop-up button in a folder's settings choosing what happens when one of its books ends.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Wenn ein Buch endet"
