          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A biblioteca do seu Mac não é afetada."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your books and reading positions are kept." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the Rebuild Directory confirmation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Deine Bücher und Lesepositionen bleiben erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tus libros y posiciones de lectura se conservan."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Vos livres et vos positions de lecture sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "I tuoi libri e le posizioni di lettura vengono mantenuti."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Seus livros e posições de leitura são mantidos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your copy of the rules is empty. Edit Rules… opens it to add some." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Clean Up Transcript sheet when the user's own rules file holds no rule. Edit Rules… is the name of a button of the sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Deine Kopie der Regeln ist leer. „Regeln bearbeiten …“ öffnet sie, damit du welche hinzufügst."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu copia de las reglas está vacía. Editar reglas… la abre para agregar algunas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Votre copie des règles est vide. Modifier les règles… l’ouvre pour en ajouter."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tua copia delle regole è vuota. Modifica regole… la apre per aggiungerne."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sua cópia das regras está vazia. Editar regras… a abre para adicionar algumas."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your copy of the rules is only in the cloud, so TextMouth asked for it and uses its own meanwhile." : {
      "comment" : "Line of the Clean Up Transcript sheet when the user's own rules file has not been downloaded from the cloud drive yet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Deine Kopie der Regeln ist nur in der Cloud, daher hat TextMouth sie angefordert und verwendet in der Zwischenzeit seine eigenen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Tu copia de las reglas solo está en la nube, así que TextMouth la solicitó y mientras tanto usa las suyas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Votre copie des règles est seulement dans le cloud, donc TextMouth l’a demandée et utilise les siennes en attendant."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tua copia delle regole è solo nel cloud, quindi TextMouth l’ha richiesta e nel frattempo usa le proprie."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Sua cópia das regras está apenas na nuvem, então o TextMouth a solicitou e usa as regras próprias enquanto isso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your edited text was also kept as %@, in the book's package." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence saying where a backup of the user's edited text was kept. %@ is a file name such as content.md.edited-20261004T123012Z, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
