          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Não foi possível ler “%1$@”: %2$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” downloads once this Mac is on a network without data limits." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed item's download did not run now: the network has data limits. Says the same as the row's wait reason. %@ is the item's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ wird heruntergeladen, sobald dieser Mac in einem Netzwerk ohne Datenlimit ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” se descargará cuando esta Mac esté en una red sin límites de datos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » se téléchargera quand ce Mac sera sur un réseau sans limite de données."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "«%@» verrà scaricato quando questo Mac sarà su una rete senza limiti di dati."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” é baixado quando este Mac estiver em uma rede sem limite de dados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” holds no DAISY book and no audio tracks to import as one book." : {
      "comment" : "What the library says as a folder chosen to import holds no DAISY book and no audio tracks. %@ is the folder's name. A sentence about what it holds follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ enthält kein DAISY-Buch und keine Audiotracks, die sich als ein Buch importieren lassen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” no contiene ningún libro DAISY ni pistas de audio para importar como un solo libro."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "« %@ » ne contient ni livre DAISY ni piste audio à importer comme un seul livre."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "«%@» non contiene alcun libro DAISY né tracce audio da importare come un unico libro."
          }
