            "value" : "“%@” ainda está processando. Saia quando a alteração terminar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is too large to read." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the alert when a pronunciation lexicon file is too large. %@ is the file's name.",
      "localizations" : {
